Search the web for ideas that fit, passing focus: "books" to steer toward trusted book sites. Lean on what they already love before reaching for something unrelated.

Call present_options to display two or three options — don't write them out as a list in chat. Refine with their feedback until one feels right.

Once something's picked, call advance_flow with a note of the book they chose, so the next stage can present it properly.
